Error [E1253]: inline dependency `ghostpkg#1.0.0` didn't resolve
  --> tests/ui/inline_dep_unresolved.jet:3:13
    |
  3 | use ghostpkg#1.0.0
    |             ^^^^^^
 Why: no local source knows a package named `ghostpkg` — the Jet registry has no fetch path yet, so an inline dependency only resolves from a committed local copy.
 Fix: commit a copy at `.jet/inline-deps/ghostpkg/<version>/`, or run `jet init` and depend on `ghostpkg` through `pkg.jet` once you have a real source for it.
